statements=[
 ('SHT01','All four explicit fields of the one optional SHADOW Type record are Name=Shadow, IconPosition=19, IsSpecialType=true and Resistances=[SHADOW]. The omitted IsPseudoType/Weaknesses/Immunities/Flags have false/empty/empty/empty defaults. Exact original complete record object is retained.','SOURCE_RAW_TYPED; exact optional sample-value formal coverage is individually bounded.'),
 ('SHT02','The nested backup file is not discovered by the top-level PBS/*.txt collection. Conditional installation under matching top-level types suffix and valid compile dependencies is required. Type compilation precedes Move, then Item and Species.','SOURCE_CONSUMER_BOUND; optional nondefault premise agrees with current WP23.'),
 ('SHT03','Type chart fields parse with *m symbol lists, then per-record duplicates are removed and terminal validation checks every referenced type against the registered Type directory. This is strict final identity validation, not an immediate *e Type schema field.','SOURCE_PRODUCER_CHAIN_BOUND; no schema-phase conflation.'),
 ('SHT04','Type Name is retained as real_name; name getter translates via TYPE_NAMES. Final type compilation extracts all raw names into that message hash. The original word Shadow is not proof of an observed localized screen.','SOURCE_CONSUMER_BOUND; generic WP03 default/localization contract applies.'),
 ('SHT05','IconPosition19 is a requested source coordinate. In the fully read Pokedex Entry info renderer, owned species types request Rect(0,icon_position*32,96,32); the Pokemon species type list is used, so the battle-only Shadow type substitution does not itself rewrite Pokedex species types. No bitmap bounds or native blit success is inferred.','SOURCE_DATA_AND_NAMED_CONSUMER_ONLY; native/media remains unobserved.'),
 ('SHT06','With MOVE_CATEGORY_PER_MOVE=false, nonzero-power GameData Move physical?/special? consume its Type physical?/special?; actual SHADOW special_type=true makes SHADOWRUSH physical? false and special? true despite its explicit Category Physical. The equivalent Battle Move queries use explicit argument, otherwise calcType, otherwise stored type.','SOURCE_BOUND; exact optional SHADOW sample flag value incorporation query OPEN.'),
 ('SHT07','Under the current default generation8-derived MOVE_CATEGORY_PER_MOVE=true, SHADOWRUSH Category Physical instead yields physical true/special false; the legacy flag is not used on that branch. These are static direct classification controls, not executed moves; original TotalPP0 remains unchanged.','SOURCE_BOUND; exact optional sample legacy-classification value reception query OPEN.'),
 ('SHT08','Chart data is defensive: SHADOW self resistance makes its generic chart contribution half; no other chart weakness is injected into the19 default Type records by the mere optional Type declaration. Default NORMAL has Fighting weakness/Ghost immunity and no Shadow entry.','SOURCE_CONSUMER_BOUND; current WP43 distinguishes optional Shadow branch.'),
 ('SHT09','Type effectiveness checks weakness before resistance before immunity, then neutral; overlap is not automatically repaired to immunity precedence. The actual optional record has only the one resistance and no overlap.','SOURCE_CONSUMER_BOUND; current WP43§3.2 already correct.'),
 ('SHT10','Battle pbCalcTypeMod for effective attack type SHADOW chooses half for a target whose shadowPokemon? is true and double otherwise; it skips ordinary defensive type combination and TarShot. Type nil returns neutral earlier. This special branch is distinct from the optional raw self resistance.','SOURCE_CONSUMER_BOUND; current WP43§3.3 already correct.'),
 ('SHT11','The Shadow Battler initializer wrapper calls the original initializer, then substitutes its battle types to [SHADOW] only if the attached Pokemon is Shadow and Type SHADOW exists. The ordinary initializer previously copied Pokemon.types. Type presence alone does not mark a Pokemon Shadow, and this write does not rewrite its persistent Species type array.','SOURCE_CONSUMER_BOUND; exact whole transformation/switch lifecycles remain separately bounded.'),
 ('SHT12','Generic Type compilation clears the registry, registers each valid record, terminal-validates, then saves the registered hash to Data/types.dat. load replaces the data constant only after load_data returns. Generic PBS export groups by stored suffix and emits schema raw properties; false and empty arrays are omitted, while explicit true/19/rawName/self-resistance remain. It writes the top-level types suffix path.','SOURCE_PRODUCER_SAVE_RELOAD_EXPORT_BOUND; no actual compiled bytes or native reload executed.'),
 ('SHT13','The compiler, writer and wrapper supply only reached prefixes. A later reference validation/save/write/underlying method exception is not an all-or-nothing registry/file/individual rollback guarantee. No gameplay, UI, compiler or storage action was executed for this packet.','SOURCE_EXCEPTION_PREFIX_BOUND; no added runtime evidence.')]
